451 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 375 0 R
/T (In 2024, this initiative reached 10 schools in Alimosho Local Government, including State Senior High School, Igando, Ikotun, Ayobo, Egon, and Tomia. Through the dedicated and selfless efforts of Afrovlanguard volunteers, we divided into groups to deliver impactful sessions, some on the same dates, other on different dates as scheduled by the school authorities. Our volunteers inspired students to adopt these values and strive for personal excellence. The school authorities expressed great excitement, acknowledging the spark of inspiration and motivation we brought to the students.)
/E (In 2024, this initiative reached 10 schools in Alimosho Local Government, including State Senior High School, Igando, Ikotun, Ayobo, Egon, and Tomia. Through the dedicated and selfless efforts of Afrovlanguard volunteers, we divided into groups to deliver impactful sessions, some on the same dates, other on different dates as scheduled by the school authorities. Our volunteers inspired students to adopt these values and strive for personal excellence. The school authorities expressed great excitement, acknowledging the spark of inspiration and motivation we brought to the students.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
