/E (As part of Afrovanguard's efforts to foster leadership and community engagement, the CEO's Time-Out with the Next Generation Genius Club provided a unique opportunity for the children to interact with prominent leaders from the community. During this event, several CEOs were invited to spend time with the students, sharing their experiences and offering guidance.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [6]
