/T (This year also while Mr Adetayo visisted, he made a significant promise to the members of the Next Generation Genius Club. In addition to an exciting excursion, he committed to awarding Senior Secondary School Level Scholarships to two outstanding students from the club. These scholarships were granted to a boy and a girl, who demonstrated exceptional performance during Afrovanguard's Values via the training. As a result, they were both awarded a spot in the school, where they are currently rounding up their SS1 first term.)
